                "title": "Merrimack Lever with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Merrimack Lever with Rectangular Rose exemplifies the town after which it is named, with a traditional style that is a great match for the rural farmhouse decor that is so popular for its elegant quaintness. The Rectangular Rose with Merrimack Lever is available in several classic finishes and some transitional finishes too, for an end look that will blend your historic home with contemporary design trends. This door leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
